239 7.6984C7.96019 7.98511 8.3193 8.28726 8.66972 8.60292C9.02013 8.91762 9.35896 9.24294 9.68622 9.57695C9.99609 9.89262 10.2963 10.216 10.5878 10.5462C10.8784 10.8753 11.1622 11.2132 11.4393 11.5598C11.6825 11.8629 11.919 12.1718 12.1507 12.4855C12.3814 12.7993 12.6073 13.1169 12.8265 13.4393C13.008 13.7057 13.1817 13.9692 13.3487 14.2309C13.5157 14.4925 13.6798 14.7589 13.842 15.0311C13.9453 15.2039 14.0505 15.3854 14.1577 15.5746C14.2571 15.7503 14.3585 15.9337 14.4598 16.1258L14.567 16.3295H14.5708Z" fill="#5F5F5F"></path></svg><span class="lg:text-[1.302vw]  text-[18px] tracking-wide font-[500] Avenir uppercase text-[#C6A664]" style="display:inline-block;opacity:0;filter:blur(20px);transform:translateY(20px)">ABOUT US</span></h2></div></div><h2 class="overflow-hidden heading text-[#7B766C]"><span class="inline-block pb-0 mr-2" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(30px)">Rooted</span><span class="inline-block pb-0 mr-2" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(30px)">in</span><span class="inline-block pb-0 mr-2" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(30px)">Pune,</span><span class="inline-block pb-0 mr-2" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(30px)">Built</span><span class="inline-block pb-0 mr-2" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(30px)">with</span><span class="inline-block pb-0 " style="opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:translateY(30px)">Purpose</span></h2><div class="text-[#5F5F5F] content"><p style="text-align:justify;">For over four decades, Pristine Properties has shaped Pune’s skyline with integrity, engineering discipline, and delightful living experiences. With 40+ delivered projects and over 10,000 happy families who trust our name, every Pristine development reflects a legacy built on consistency, credibility, and lasting value. From landmark residences to city-defining commercial spaces, Pristine continues to craft environments that stand the test of time.</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px) scale(0.6)"><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex w-fit overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-[#A67C1F] group cursor-pointer "><span class="
          absolute inset-0 bg-[#A67C1F]
          scale-x-0 origin-center opacity-0
          transition-all duration-500
          ease-[cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]
          group-hover:scale-x-100 group-hover:opacity-100
        "></span><span class="
          relative z-10 Avenir !font-[600] tracking-[-0.03em]
          px-6 py-3 lg:py-[0.5vw] lg:px-[2vw]
          text-[16px] lg:text-[1.042vw]
