image_15_3e8dadf2e4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="lg:text-[1.302vw] text-[20px] font-[500] text-[#7B766C]">People First</h3><div class="lg:text-[0.833vw] text-[16px] text-[#5F5F5F]"><p style="text-align:center;"><span style="background-color:transparent;">Over 10,000 families, countless partnerships - one learning: people always come first.</span></p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-[10px] lg:h-[24.5vw] h-[332px] w-full absolute bottom-0 -z-10"></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-center my-5 lg:my-[2vw] items-center"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px) scale(0.6)"><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex w-fit overflow-hidden rounded-full border border-[#A67C1F] group cursor-pointer "><span class="
