ttps%3A%2F%2Fbackend.pristinepune.com%2Fuploads%2FSatav_5428dd6507.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.pristinepune.com%2Fuploads%2FSatav_5428dd6507.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.pristinepune.com%2Fuploads%2FSatav_5428dd6507.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=12lWvwj9WtQ" data-fancybox="Testimonials" data-caption="Testimonials View" class="absolute bottom-[5%] block left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"><div class="rounded-full w-[208px]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px) scale(0.6)"><img alt="video" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="bg-white rounded-full" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/videoicon.svg"/></div></a></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><a class="flex items-center gap-4 h-[400px] lg:h-[27.813vw] lg:w-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-pointer" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tMrGuJ5_AMQ" data-fancybox="Testimonials" data-caption="Testimonials View"><img alt=" Mr. &amp; Mrs. Agarwal" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-cover h-[400px] rounded-[10px] lg:h-[27.813vw] lg:w-full w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.pristinepune.com%2Fuploads%2FMr_Agrawal_930d5a7996.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.pristinepune.com%2Fuploads%2FMr_Agrawal_930d5a7996.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.pristinepune.com%2Fuploads%2FMr_Agrawal_930d5a7996.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tMrGuJ5_AMQ" data-fancybox="Testimonials" data-caption="Testimonials View" class="absolute bottom-[5%] block left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"><div class="rounded-full w-[208px]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px) scale(0.6)"><img alt="video" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="bg-white rounded-full" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/videoicon.svg"/></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-[40%] overflow-hidden h-full w-full"><div class="swiper testimonialSwiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p>Sometimes, everything just aligns.</p><p>For Mr. &amp; Mrs. Gaur, YOO Pristine brought together all the right elements.</p><p>Hear their experience - what worked, and what made the decision easy.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Mr and Mrs Gaur</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->YOO Pristine<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p>Clarity makes all the difference.</p><p>For Mrs. Niti Auluck, YOO Pristine brought comfort, confidence, and the right decision.</p><p>Hear her experience - what she found, and what made it feel like home.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Mrs. Niti Auluck</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->YOO Pristine<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p>Not every decision needs overthinking.<br>For Mr. &amp; Mrs. Kashid, YOO Pristine simply felt right.<br>Hear their experience - what stood out, and what made them choose this address.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Mr. &amp; Mrs. Kashid</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->YOO Pristine<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">At Pristine Properties, we don’t just build homes — we shape elevated living experiences. Hear from our partners, Mr. Aditya Chourasia and Mr. Sujit Pandey of Imagine Homeland Pvt. Ltd., as they share their perspective on the thoughtful architecture and customer-first philosophy that define Pristine.</p><p style="text-align:justify;"><br>From intelligently planned layouts to sweeping views from every residence, this isn’t just a development — it’s a new benchmark in refined living.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Mr. Aditya Chourasia / Mr. Sujit Pandey</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine One<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">In this edition of Customer Speaks, Mr. Muthiyan and his family share why being part of a community like Pristine Kyra mattered just as much as finding the right home. Hear what made this community the right choice for their family.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]"> Mr. &amp; Mrs. Muthiyan</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine Kyra<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">Our channel partners choose Pristine Properties for our commitment to quality, seamless collaboration, thoughtful planning, and unwavering support. Together, we're creating lasting value and shaping the future of real estate—one landmark at a time.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Partner Testimonial Kyra</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Multiple Partner<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">Hear from Mr. Mahesh Masulkar from Masulkar Estate Pvt Ltd on why he trusts Pristine Properties.</p><p style="text-align:justify;"><br>From seamless brokerage to dedicated sourcing support, we provide the tools our partners need to thrive.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Mr. Mahesh Masulkar</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine One<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">We don’t just build spaces; we build lasting relationships.</p><p style="text-align:justify;"><br>"You never feel like a third party here." — Those words from Mr. Vijay Dama truly capture the heart of what we do at Pristine Properties.</p><p style="text-align:justify;"><br>Whether it’s our cooperative sourcing team or our commitment to high-end specs, we’re dedicated to going the extra mile for our partners and clients alike.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Mr. Vijay Dama</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine One<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p>Some homes are chosen together.</p><p>For the Gaikwad family, YOO Pristine offered exactly what they were looking for.</p><p>Hear their experience - what mattered most, and what made this the right decision.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]">Gaikwad family</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->YOO Pristine<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">In this edition of Customer Speaks, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Site share how Pristine Kyra's state-of-the-art amenities and thoughtful attention to detail made a lasting impression. Explore what made Pristine Kyra’s thoughtful design and amenities stand out to them.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]"> Mr. &amp; Mrs. Site</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine Kyra<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">In this edition of Customer Speaks, the Desarda family shares why Pristine Kyra offered something meaningful for every member of their family. Hear how Pristine Kyra became a home that brings every generation together.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]"> Mr. Desarda</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine Kyra<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">In this edition of Customer Speaks, Dr. Satav and his family share why Pristine Kyra gives them the sense of peace, comfort, and everyday living they were looking for. Hear what made Pristine Kyra the right choice for their family.&nbsp;</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]"> Mr. &amp; Mrs. Satav</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine Kyra<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-[2vw] gap-5 "><div class="text-[#5F5F5F]  lg:text-[1.1vw] text-[20px] font-[400] Avenir"><p style="text-align:justify;">In this edition of Customer Speaks, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Agarwal share why they chose to move to Viman Nagar for Pristine Kyra. Watch their story and discover what made Kyra feel like the right place to call home.</p></div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#5F5F5F80] "></div><div class="flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-5"><h2 class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#BE9C58]"> Mr. &amp; Mrs. Agarwal</h2><p class="lg:text-[1.042vw] text-[18px] text-[#5F5F5F]">(<!-- -->Pristine Kyra<!-- -->)</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-5 my-5 lg:my-[2vw] "><div class="cursor-pointer"><img alt="left" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="lg:w-[2.604vw] Testimonials-prev w-[50px] lg:h-[2.604vw] h-[50px]" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/leftarrow.svg"/></div><div class="cursor-pointer"><img alt="left" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="lg:w-[2.604vw] Testimonials-next w-[50px] lg:h-[2.604vw] h-[50px]" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/rightarrow.svg"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="overflow-hidden  relative w-full h-full bg-[#f9f7f4]"><div class="relative containery containerx lg:!pr-0 h-full w-full z-20 "><div class="flex justify-center items-center"><div><h2 class=" uppercase flex items-center lg:gap-[1vw] gap-4  text-[#C6A664]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="lg:h-[1.25vw] lg:w-[1.25vw]" width="23" height="24" viewBox="0 0 23 24" fill="none"><path d="M5.95889 9.30462C4.97231 6.7513 8.36259 0.281589 12.0164 1.3145C15.6702 2.34742 16.7823 10.8617 15.1933 14.1902C13.6044 17.5177 10.3058 20.5518 5.95889 9.30462Z" fill="#E76229"></path><path d="M8.02993 21.8464C-0.961248 28.7138 -0.338606 17.5101 0.365127 11.2547C1.06886 4.99829 7.95849 5.90957 9.44029 8.39339C10.9221 10.8772 15.7536 15.9481 8.02993 21.8464Z" fill="#E98826"></path><path d="M10.8929 21.1427L10.9006 21.1321C10.9624 21.0539 10.9576 20.9631 10.919 20.8946C10.9064 20.8714 10.8881 20.8502 10.8688 20.8338C10.8523 20.8203 10.834 20.8087 10.8147 20.801L10.9373 20.7189C11.4798 20.355 12.0127 19.9775 12.5359 19.5895C13.0282 19.2236 13.5148 18.8471 13.9907 18.4552C14.4666 18.0623 14.9299 17.6559 15.374 17.2311L15.4387 17.1703C15.5362 17.0805 15.6366 16.9888 15.7041 16.8633C15.735 16.8054 15.763 16.7446 15.7872 16.6819C15.8123 16.6181 15.8335 16.5593 15.8528 16.5013C15.9194 16.3044 15.9754 16.1026 16.0246 15.899C16.0739 15.6924 16.1154 15.4906 16.154 15.2918C16.2708 14.6807 16.3577 14.059 16.4137 13.4335C16.4697 12.8022 16.4948 12.1689 16.4899 11.5376C16.4841 10.8425 16.4417 10.1397 16.3384 9.44856C16.2351 8.75352 16.07 8.06813 15.82 7.4117C15.541 6.679 15.2166 5.96079 14.8556 5.26092C14.4801 4.53402 14.066 3.82932 13.6209 3.15069C13.4308 2.86108 13.2329 2.57438 13.0253 2.29153